No.

816
00:36:00.820 --> 00:36:02.500
Joel, you stinker.

817
00:36:03.120 --> 00:36:03.980
All right, bud.

818
00:36:04.100 --> 00:36:04.620
Thank you.

819
00:36:04.620 --> 00:36:05.640
I'll talk to you soon.

820
00:36:05.860 --> 00:36:06.560
See you, guys.

821
00:36:06.560 --> 00:36:07.520
Thank you.

822
00:36:07.820 --> 00:36:07.870
Bye.

823
00:36:16.180 --> 00:36:18.260
Hi, I'm Jessica St. Clair.

824
00:36:18.580 --> 00:36:19.940
And I'm June Diane Raphael.

825
00:36:20.080 --> 00:36:26.200
And we are two friends trying to survive the chaos and celebrate the joy that life throws our way.

826
00:36:26.320 --> 00:36:29.480
